WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,690
This is really the sun coming out in the west

2
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,220
Why? The sea is your home?

3
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,980
Only you can go, not me.

4
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,860
Don’t I find this strange?

5
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,380
No other meaning

6
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,260
But you are so good

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,540
Why do you think of going to sea?

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,480
I have no money. I want to make some money to spend.

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,670
Wasn't the tide low yesterday?

10
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:31,070
Why is the tide starting to ebb again? The tide is ebbing.

11
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:39,220
what's going on

12
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,020
I've never seen anything weird like this before.

13
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:45,350
I don't want to talk about it now

14
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:55,060
I don't want to say such weird things anymore now.

15
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:56,740
Can't go to sea today

16
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,160
low tide

17
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,800
The sea water is full of yellow sand

18
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,360
This is a typhoon coming

19
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:09,190
But the loudspeakers in the village did not broadcast

20
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:10,710
Radio chassis forecast

21
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:12,310
It didn’t say there was a typhoon in the past two days.

22
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:15,660
Isn't it possible that the old boat head made the mistake?

23
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,660
Weather forecasts are often inaccurate

24
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:18,980
There is no radio in the village

25
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:20,380
It's because of the village cadres

26
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:22,380
I didn’t know there was a typhoon and it was temporarily rescheduled.

27
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,160
The sea flute has appeared

28
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:28,630
The sea water is turbid with sediment

29
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:29,710
The air is stuffy

30
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:30,670
And you guys take a look

31
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:32,510
There was nothing in the dark just now

32
00:01:32,990 --> 00:01:34,430
But just for a moment

33
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:35,710
Small fish and shrimp

34
00:01:35,710 --> 00:01:39,030
He started jumping crazily on the beach, which meant

35
00:01:39,230 --> 00:01:40,510
After half a day of decision

36
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:43,190
It’s undeniable that there will be a typhoon here.

37
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,710
The bow of the old boat has been at sea for a lifetime

38
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:45,750
Fishing all my life

39
00:01:45,950 --> 00:01:49,110
What he said is not wrong. Let's go back and not go to sea.

40
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:50,510
How much can you earn in one day?

41
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:51,670
But if you go out to sea

42
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:53,830
I might have lost my life and left.

43
00:01:53,830 --> 00:01:55,150
Go back and spend time with your wife and kids
